  {
    "id": 1023004030060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "──ね、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "023",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300403/1023004030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん？\r\nどうした雛菜",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004030070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "プロデューサーって\r\nどうやってプロデューサーになったの？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300403/1023004030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？\r\nなんだ、急に",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004030080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "なんか、アイドルの人ってアイドルじゃなくなったら\r\n何になるのかな～って調べてたの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300403/1023004030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\nあの子は、芸能活動を続けるんじゃなかったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004030090,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300403/1023004030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あの、トールくんの話じゃないのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004030100,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あ～……\r\nあの人はそうみたいだね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300403/1023004030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004030110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "タレントとか歌手とか俳優とかの芸能人を続ける人もいれば\r\n振付とか作詞とかスタッフになる人もいて",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300403/1023004030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004030120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ブランドプロデュースとか\r\nアイドルプロデュースする人も結構いるんだって",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300403/1023004030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近はアイドルを卒業した後も\r\n色々な道で活躍する人が増えてるよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004030130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だから、プロデューサーはどうやって\r\nアイドルのプロデューサーになったのかなって",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300403/1023004030130"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうことか\r\nうーん…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "元々アイドルをやってた人と\r\n俺みたいな場合じゃ結構違うのかもしれないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004030140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あ～、そっか",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300403/1023004030140"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺の場合は２８３プロに入社して、\r\nプロデューサーになって……っていう形だけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルの活動形態とか、事務所によって\r\nやり方もそれぞれだろうし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004030150,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～\r\nなんか結構大変そうだね～……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300403/1023004030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004030160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "でも、やっぱりアイドルだった人が\r\nアイドルのプロデューサーやるのっていいのかな",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300403/1023004030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004030170,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "自分の経験したこととか、参考になりそうだもんね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300403/1023004030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ、そうかもしれないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういう人は、アイドルの気持ちを\r\nよくわかってあげられるのかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004030180,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300403/1023004030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004030190,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だけど別にそうじゃなくても、プロデューサーは\r\nちゃんとプロデューサーできてるでしょ～？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300403/1023004030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうか？\r\nそう言ってもらえるとありがたいけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004030200,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "なんでプロデューサーは雛菜じゃないし\r\nアイドルしてたわけでもないのに",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300403/1023004030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004030210,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜のことわかるのかな～って\r\nたまに不思議に思うもん",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300403/1023004030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは雛菜が自分の考えを伝えてくれたり\r\n意見を出してくれるからかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけど本当はもっと雛菜のこと\r\n理解したいと思ってて──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
